<h1 id="release-notes-2-0">Release notes: 2.0</h1>
<p>Version <em>two</em> brings <strong>faster</strong> parsing, <code>strict</code> mode and a new <a href="docs/guide.md">guide</a>. Snake_case names stay put, and 5 &lt; 6 &amp; 7 &gt; 2.</p>
<h2 id="changes-in-detail">Changes in detail</h2>
<ol>
<li>Parser rewritten around a block tree.</li>
<li>Escapes: *not emphasis* and `not code`.</li>
<li>Images: <img src="img/logo.png" alt="logo"> are kept.</li>
</ol>
<ul>
<li>Output is HTML-escaped</li>
<li>Lists may be <em>nested</em> only one level: - not supported yet</li>
</ul>
<blockquote>
<p>Note: the old flag <code>--legacy</code> is gone. Use <code>--strict</code> instead.</p>
</blockquote>
<pre><code class="language-sh">mdconv --strict notes.md &gt; out.html</code></pre>
<hr>
